  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vevent\" style=\"font-size: 88%; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n\n<caption class=\"summary\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold\">United States presidential election, 2032\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c2/US_flag_51stars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150826055222\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"US flag 51stars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_51stars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:left;\" class=\"noprint\">2028&#160;←<br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;\"><b>November 2, 2032</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:right;\" class=\"noprint\">→&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2036\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2036\">2036</a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><small>All eligable voters who participate</small><br /><small>51% of the vote votes needed to win</small>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Turnout\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center\">78.0%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/4a/Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez_Official_Portrait.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210219164750\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez Official Portrait\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/4a/Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez_Official_Portrait.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20210219164750\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"188\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez Official Portrait.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez_Official_Portrait.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/05/Benraylujan2032.png/revision/latest?cb=20210221060411\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Benraylujan2032\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/05/Benraylujan2032.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/165?cb=20210221060411\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"165\" height=\"206\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Benraylujan2032.png\" data-image-key=\"Benraylujan2032.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez\" title=\"Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez\">Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Ben Ray Lujan\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Progress\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Democrat\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">New York\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Texas\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dylan_J._Price\" title=\"Dylan J. Price\">Dylan J. Price</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Gretchen Whitmer\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">61.1%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">22.9%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/8/81/Madison-Cawthorn.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20210222104651\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Madison-Cawthorn\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"196\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Madison-Cawthorn.jpeg\" data-image-key=\"Madison-Cawthorn.jpeg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/8/81/Madison-Cawthorn.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/130?cb=20210222104651\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/9f/20190220_224217.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190221054445\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"20190220 224217\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"157\" height=\"181\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"20190220 224217.jpg\" data-image-key=\"20190220_224217.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/9f/20190220_224217.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/157?cb=20190221054445\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Madison Cawthorn\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_P._Bush\">George Prescott Bush</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">National Union\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Libertarian\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">North Carolina\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Florida\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Candace Owens\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Justin_Rockefeller\">Justin Rockefeller</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">6.6%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">9.4%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left; text-size: 80%\"><b>President before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez\" title=\"Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez\">Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez</a><br />\nProgressive\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right; text-size: 80%\"><b>Elected President</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez\" title=\"Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez\">Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez</a><br />\nProgressive\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>United States presidential election of 2032</b> was the sixty-second quadrennial presidential election, held on Tuesday, November 8, 2032. Ocasio-Cortez won the second largest victory of the popular vote in the 21st century, being elected on the first ballot with 61% of the vote. Ocasio-Cortez touted a strong economic recovery from economic malaise of the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Reset\" title=\"Great Reset\">Great Reset</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Market_Crash_of_2027\" title=\"Market Crash of 2027\">2027-29 recession</a>, as well as the widespread perception that his presidency had overseen a revival of national confidence and prestige. The enactment of Progressive reforms, such as Universal Healthcare and housing benefits, had proven to be highly popular with most Americans.\n</p><p>Although some political pundits predicted a close race, Ocasio-Cortez went on to win the greatest landslide since the beginning of the <a href=\"/wiki/Seventh_Party_System\" title=\"Seventh Party System\">multi-party system</a>. Ocasio-Cortez carried popular majorities on the first ballot in every state except Montana and North Dakota.\n</p><p>Because the Republican Party had ceased to exist, many conservative parties threw their weight behind the Libertarian Party and the Patriot Party, while the election was a final attempt for the Democratic Party to be preserved. The failure to retake the presidency was the final nail in the coffin for the Democratic Party, causing it to disband the following year. Meanwhile, the failure of either National Union Party or Libertarian Party to take the presidency had caused the rise of the <a href=\"/wiki/Conservative_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Conservative Party (United States)\">Conservative party</a> soon after.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Nominations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Nominations</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Progress\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Progress</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Democratic\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Democratic</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Libertarian\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Libertarian</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#National_Union\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>National Union</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Green\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Green</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Nominations\">Nominations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2032%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Progress\"><b>Progress</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2032%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"font-size:90%; text-align:center;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"30\" style=\"background:#f1f1f1;\"><big><b>Progress Party Ticket, 2032</b></big>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:3em; font-size:135%; background:#DC143C; width:200px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dylan_J._Price\" title=\"Dylan J. Price\"><span style=\"color:white\">Alexandria-Ocasio Cortez</span></a>\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:3em; font-size:135%; background:#DC143C; width:200px;\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Ivory Toldson (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSXZvcnlfVG9sZHNvbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\"><span style=\"color:white\">Dylan J. Price</span></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"color:#000; font-size:100%; background:#ffd0d7;\">\n<td style=\"width:3em; width:200px;\"><i><b>for President</b></i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:3em; width:200px;\"><i><b>for Vice President</b></i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/4a/Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez_Official_Portrait.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210219164750\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez Official Portrait\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"225\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez Official Portrait.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez_Official_Portrait.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/4a/Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez_Official_Portrait.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20210219164750\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/4a/Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez_Official_Portrait.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210219164750\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez Official Portrait\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/4a/Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez_Official_Portrait.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20210219164750\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"225\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez Official Portrait.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez_Official_Portrait.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/4a/Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez_Official_Portrait.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20210219164750\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Alexandria_Ocasio-Cortez_Official_Portrait.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/45/Dylan_J_Price.png/revision/latest?cb=20150829215426\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dylan J Price\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"219\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dylan J Price.png\" data-image-key=\"Dylan_J_Price.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/45/Dylan_J_Price.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150829215426\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/45/Dylan_J_Price.png/revision/latest?cb=20150829215426\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dylan J Price\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/45/Dylan_J_Price.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150829215426\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"219\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Dylan J Price.png\" data-image-key=\"Dylan_J_Price.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/45/Dylan_J_Price.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150829215426\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Dylan_J_Price.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/President_of_the_United_States\" title=\"President of the United States\">47th</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/President_of_the_United_States\" title=\"President of the United States\">President of the United States</a><br /><small>(2029–2037)</small>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"new\" title=\"Vice Presidents of the United States (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVmljZV9QcmVzaWRlbnRzX29mX3RoZV9Vbml0ZWRfU3RhdGVzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">50th</span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Vice_President_of_the_United_States\" title=\"Vice President of the United States\">Vice President of the United States</a><br /><small>(2029–2037)</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>With an incumbent president running for re-election against token opposition, the race for the Progressive Presidential nomination was largely uneventful, however Vice President Price faced a challenge at the convention from Progressive leaders who attempted to draft California Governor Eric Garcetti for the number two slot. Garcetti did not challenge the party's call for a vote for running mate, but did not expressly endorse it either. Ultimately, Price remained on the ballot with 53% of support from the delegates at the Progress Party Convention in Columbus, Ohio. The delegates unanimously re-nominated President Ocasio-Cortez for a second term.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Democratic\"><b>Democratic</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2032%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"font-size:90